@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il29-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 2 (the territorial charge) and s 2A (winnings from gambling, lotteries and
-- prize-bearing activity), composed with the two statuses of s 1.  Row IL-29.
--
-- s 2: an Israeli resident is charged on income produced or accrued in Israel or outside it; a foreign
-- resident on income produced or accrued in Israel.  Row IL-08 encodes the same sentence for a person whose
-- residence is an input; this module takes both statuses, because s 1's second limb can make one person
-- both (fork BS).
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 2: the territorial charge`

-- src:ITO:210 | מס הכנסה יהא משתלם, בכפוף להוראות פקודה זו, לכל שנת מס, בשיעורים המפורטים להלן, על הכנסתו של אדם תושב ישראל שהופקה או שנצמחה בישראל או מחוץ לישראל ועל הכנסתו של אדם תושב חוץ שהופקה או שנצמחה בישראל, ממקורות אלה:

@ref ITO s 2, chapeau, line 210: fork BS
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the person is both an Israeli resident and a foreign resident, and the text does not say which status the charge reads` MEANS
    REFUSE "the person is both an Israeli resident and a foreign resident (the second limb of the definition of foreign resident), and the text does not say which status the charge of s 2 reads: worldwide income, or income produced or accrued in Israel only"

@ref ITO s 2, chapeau, line 210
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the person is neither an Israeli resident nor a foreign resident, which cannot be` MEANS
    REFUSE "the person is neither an Israeli resident nor a foreign resident, which the definitions do not allow"

-- Whether the charge reaches income of the kind asked about.
@ref ITO s 2, chapeau, line 210
GIVEN produced IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      foreign  IS A BOOLEAN
      r        IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the charge reaches income produced or accrued in Israel:` produced `, of a person who is an Israeli resident:` resident `and a foreign resident:` foreign `, under` r MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF   resident AND NOT foreign THEN TRUE
        IF   foreign AND NOT resident THEN produced
        IF   resident AND foreign
        THEN CONSIDER r's `both statuses`
             WHEN `the foreign resident status prevails` THEN produced
             WHEN `the Israeli resident status prevails` THEN TRUE
             WHEN `declined where the readings differ` THEN
                 IF produced THEN TRUE ELSE `the person is both an Israeli resident and a foreign resident, and the text does not say which status the charge reads`
        OTHERWISE `the person is neither an Israeli resident nor a foreign resident, which cannot be`

GIVEN resident IS A BOOLEAN
      foreign  IS A BOOLEAN
      r        IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
      item     IS AN `An item of income, for the charge of section 2`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2 — the item is within the charge, for a person who is an Israeli resident:` resident `and a foreign resident:` foreign `, under` r `:` item MEANS
    `s 2 — the charge reaches income produced or accrued in Israel:` (item's `produced or accrued in Israel`) `, of a person who is an Israeli resident:` resident `and a foreign resident:` foreign `, under` r

§ `Section 2A: winnings from gambling, lotteries and prize-bearing activity`

-- src:ITO:248 | (א) השתכרות או רווח של אדם תושב ישראל, שהופקו או שנצמחו בישראל או מחוץ לישראל, וכן השתכרות או רווח של אדם תושב חוץ, שהופקו או שנצמחו בישראל, שמקורם בהימורים, בהגרלות או בפעילות נושאת פרסים, יובאו בחשבון בקביעת רווחיו או הכנסתו ויראו אותם לענין פקודה זו כהכנסה, למעט לענין קיזוז הפסדים.
-- src:ITO:249 | (ב) הוראות סעיף קטן (א) לא יחולו על כל אחד מאלה:
-- src:ITO:250 | (1) השתכרות או רווח שהם הכנסה ממקור אחר על פי פקודה זו;
-- src:ITO:251 | (2) השתכרות או רווח מפרסים שניתנו במסגרת אישית;
-- src:ITO:252 | (3) השתכרות או רווח מהגרלות או מפרסים שנקבעו על ידי שר האוצר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת.

-- (a) brings the winnings into the reckoning of profits or income, on the same territorial terms as s 2, and
-- deems them income for the purposes of the Ordinance except for the set-off of losses.  (b) disapplies (a)
-- for (1) winnings that are income from another source under the Ordinance, (2) prizes given in a personal
-- setting, (3) winnings from lotteries or prizes the Minister of Finance determined with the approval of the
-- Knesset Finance Committee (the determinations are not in the source bundle: whether one reaches the
-- winnings is an input, with a citation to be supplied by the caller).

@ref ITO s 2A(b), lines 249-252
GIVEN w IS A `Winnings under section 2A`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2A(b) — the winnings are outside paragraph (a):` w MEANS
        w's `income from another source under the Ordinance`
    OR  w's `a prize given in a personal setting`
    OR  w's `a lottery or prize determined by the Minister of Finance with the approval of the Finance Committee`

@export Whether winnings from gambling, lotteries or prize-bearing activity are taken into account and deemed income by Income Tax Ordinance s 2A (not where they are income from another source, a prize given in a personal setting, or a lottery or prize the Minister determined), for a person with the two statuses of s 1
@ref ITO s 2A(a), line 248
GIVEN resident IS A BOOLEAN
      foreign  IS A BOOLEAN
      r        IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
      w        IS A `Winnings under section 2A`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2A — the winnings are taken into account and deemed income by section 2A, for a person who is an Israeli resident:` resident `and a foreign resident:` foreign `, under` r `:` w MEANS
    IF   `s 2A(b) — the winnings are outside paragraph (a):` w
    THEN FALSE
    ELSE `s 2 — the charge reaches income produced or accrued in Israel:` (w's `produced or accrued in Israel`) `, of a person who is an Israeli resident:` resident `and a foreign resident:` foreign `, under` r

-- "למעט לענין קיזוז הפסדים": section 2A does not deem the winnings income for the set-off of losses.  This
-- is all the text of s 2A says about set-off; the set-off sections are not in this row.
@ref ITO s 2A(a), line 248
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2A deems the winnings income for the purpose of the set-off of losses` MEANS FALSE
